_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104129.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-17T21:10:42Z"},"body":"This adds a GDExtension interface function, that allows a GDExtension to register a callback, that can be called by the Godot editor to determine which classes it's using.\r\n\r\nI created this to help @YeldhamDev with the work he's doing to allow recompiling Godot with only the classes used by a particular project.\r\n\r\nIt worked for me in a quick test!\r\n\r\nI'd appreciate feedback on the name of the new function: `editor_register_get_used_classes_callback`\r\n\r\nIt ends up with quite a few prefixes and suffixes in there. :-) I put \"editor\" since the only use I can think of for this is in the editor, but it wouldn't really be a problem to allow this always?\r\n\r\nPR https://github.com/godotengine/godot-cpp/pull/1743 implements this for godot-cpp","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104129/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":4,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timel